  <title>Contact history</title>

  <p>Open it with <guiseq><gui>Customer</gui><gui>History
  overview</gui></guiseq> or <guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Contacts</gui>
  <gui>Contact history</gui></guiseq>, and choose the <gui>Contact</gui>. Each
  tab shows one side of their history:</p>

  <terms>
    <item><title><gui>Invoices</gui></title>
    <p>Their posted invoices. Double click one to open it as it was printed;
    right click and choose <gui>Invoice history</gui> to find it in <link
    xref="invoice_history"/>.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Payments received</gui></title>
    <p>Their payments, including miscellaneous revenue.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Products</gui></title>
    <p>Every product they bought, added up. Select several rows to hide them
    from the list, or right click for <gui>Product hub</gui>.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Resources</gui></title>
    <p>Notes, calls and to-do items kept about them, with what is still
    <gui>To be done</gui>.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Documents</gui></title>
    <p>Documents made for them.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Statements</gui></title>
    <p>Their statements. Right click one and choose <gui>View pdf</gui> to see
    it.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Warranty</gui></title>
    <p>Events recorded against serial numbers for this contact, such as
    repairs; see <link xref="product_serial_numbers"/>.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Incoming invoices</gui></title>
    <p>Bills you received from them, when the contact is also a
    vendor.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Shipping</gui></title>
    <p>What was shipped to them, with tracking numbers. Right click for the
    <gui>Invoice history</gui> of the shipment's invoice.</p></item>
  </terms>

  <p>A tab with something in it shows how many rows it holds. Drag a tab
  out of the window to see it in a window of its own beside
  the others; closing that window puts the tab back. <gui>Contact hub</gui>
  opens <link xref="contact_hub"/> and <gui>Report hub</gui> exports what is
  shown; see <link xref="report_hub"/>.</p>

</page>
